<title>USA: Orbit International Q1 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Orbit International Q1 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.06     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net profit		   409     loss	   770</p>
<p> Revs			 3,970		    2,881</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,820		    5,886</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Orbit International Corp.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 operating net was the same as net income. Q1 1996 operating net was a profit of $771,000, or $0.13 per share, excluding an $0.26 per share charge from discontinued operations but including a gain of $815,000, or $0.14 per share, from the final payment of royalty income from an agreement with a former affiliate. Without this gain, operating income for Q1 1996 would have been a loss of $44,000, or $0.01 per share.</p>
</text>
